⍝ Prove the plumbing before writing a service:
⍝ Dyalog → SQAPL → unixODBC → psqlODBC → Postgres, and back.
'SQA'⎕CY'sqapl'
Say←{⍞←⍵,⎕UCS 10}
Env←{2 ⎕NQ'.' 'GetEnvironment' ⍵}
{}SQA.Init''
conn←'Driver={PostgreSQL Unicode};Server=',(Env'PGHOST'),';Port=',(Env'PGPORT'),';Database=',Env'PGDATABASE'
Say'CONNECT ',⍕SQA.Connect'C1' ''(Env'PGPASSWORD')(Env'PGUSER')('DriverOptions'conn)

⍝ (W) and (Q) ask ODBC for wide (Unicode) text in and out
text←'⍳⍴ café it''s; --x'
r←SQA.Do'C1' 'SELECT CAST(:<C100(W): AS text) :>C100(W):'text
Say'ROUNDTRIP ',⍕text≡⊃⊃3⊃r

⍝ Postgres builds the JSON; APL only parses it
r←SQA.Do'C1' 'SELECT CAST(json_build_object(''n'',NULL,''t'',CAST(:<C100(W): AS text)) AS text) :>C100000(Q):'text
Say'JSON ',1 ⎕JSON ⎕JSON⊃⊃3⊃r

r←SQA.Do'C1' 'SELECT * FROM no_such_table'
Say'ERROR ',(⍕⊃r),' SQLSTATE ',⊃2⊃r
⎕OFF 0
